	(text "Provides the radio and antenna, USB-C, LiPo charger, 3.3 V regulator and USB bootloader.\nPads 15 to 22 are on the underside of the XIAO (Seeed bottom-pad drawing).\nSense version: 6-axis IMU and PDM microphone are on the module, on its own internal pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 35.5 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "dc2d2011-2a23-54e7-b78d-8ed617e942ec")
